{"seq":4,"slug":"payload-optimization","title":"Payload Optimization","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/payload-optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prompt-compression","title":"Prompt 压缩","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/payload-optimization/prompt-compression","wordCount":2194,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"output-control-streaming","title":"输出控制与流式","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/payload-optimization/output-control-streaming","wordCount":2202,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"batching-and-async","title":"批处理与异步化","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/payload-optimization/batching-and-async","wordCount":2355,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"请求里的每一个 token 都在消耗预算与时间。本章聚焦单次请求的真实负载：先用指令去冗余、few-shot 精选、检索收紧与历史摘要化给 prompt 瘦身，再通过 max_tokens、结构化输出与流式控制输出端的开销与感知延迟，最后用批处理 API、请求合并与异步化把可以离线的负载移出同步链路。三篇文档共同回答一个问题：在不牺牲质量的前提下，如何让每个请求只携带必要的信息、只生成必要的内容、只在必要的时刻占用在线资源。\n"}